OL,3,CEngland's Ivan Toney charged with
OL,4,Cassault over incident in Soho nightclub
OL,6,FEngland footballer Ivan Toney has been
OL,7,Fcharged with assault following an
OL,8,Fincident at a nightclub in Soho.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police said Toney,
OL,11,F30, of Northampton, was charged on
OL,12,FThursday July 31 with assault causing
OL,13,Factual bodily harm.
OL,15,FThe force said the charge relates to
OL,16,Fan assault which reportedly took place
OL,17,Fon December 6 last year at a nightclub
OL,18,Fon Wardour Street in central London.
