OL,3,CEngland's Ivan Toney charged with
OL,4,Cassault over incident in Soho nightclub
OL,6,FToney, a striker for Saudi Pro League
OL,7,Fclub Al-Ahli, will appear at
OL,8,FWestminster Magistrates' Court on
OL,9,FThursday September 24.
OL,11,FThe Sun newspaper reported on December
OL,12,F8 that Toney had been arrested after
OL,13,Fan alleged headbutt.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Toney said: "Ivan
OL,16,Facknowledges the charge and although
OL,17,Fhe is naturally shocked, he looks
OL,18,Fforward to being given the opportunity
OL,19,Fto clear his name in court."
