OL,3,CEngland's Ivan Toney charged with
OL,4,Cassault over incident in Soho nightclub
OL,6,FAccording to reports, the alleged
OL,7,Fincident took place at 100 Wardour
OL,8,FStreet, which has since closed.
OL,10,FToney, who was a striker for
OL,11,FBrentford, was at the centre of one of
OL,12,Fthe most curious transfers on deadline
OL,13,Fday in August 2024 when he completed a
OL,14,Flate move to Al-Ahli worth a reported
OL,15,F#40 million.
